content.text:
Since `Guild.premium` is a one-to-one relation to `PremiumModel`, use a nested `update` inside `prisma.guild.update`:

```ts
await prisma.guild.update({
  where: { guildId: "123" },
  data: {
    premium: {
      update: {
        active: true,
        subtype_monthly: true,
      },
    },
  },
});
```

If `Guild` might not have a `PremiumModel` yet, use `upsert` instead of `update` inside `premium`.

Source: `apps/docs/content/docs/orm/v7/reference/prisma-client-reference.mdx` — "One-to-one relations › Nested update example" (lines 5206–5217).

